        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Arthur Koestler, Carl Jung, Paul Kammerer, Eugen Bleuler, Sigmund Freud\n- Concepts: synchronicity, seriality, psychoanalysis\n- Places: Burghölzli hospital, Vienna\n- Works: The Roots of Coincidence\n\nFacts:\n- Carl Jung was a notable research scientist based at Burghölzli hospital under Eugen Bleuler.\n- Carl Jung came to the attention of Sigmund Freud, the Viennese founder of psychoanalysis.\n- The Roots of Coincidence was influenced by Carl Jung's concept of synchronicity.\n- The Roots of Coincidence was also influenced by the seriality of Paul Kammerer.",
